<title>SWEDEN: Astra says Losec sales rise 14 pct Q1.</title>
<headline>Astra says Losec sales rise 14 pct Q1.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish drugs group Astra reported on Monday sales of the following products in the first three months on 1997.</p>
<p>    (Mln SKR)				Q1 97	 Q1 96</p>
<p> Losec (Astra's own sales)	     4,797   vs  4,206</p>
<p> Losec sales (total in world)	  7,050   vs  5,900</p>
<p> Pulmicort				   1,205   vs  1,104</p>
<p> Seloken					 638   vs    613</p>
<p> Plendil					 506   vs    477</p>
<p> Xylocaine				     413   vs    425</p>
<p> Bricanyl					311   vs    304</p>
<p> Rhinocort				     259   vs    233</p>
<p> Imdur					   206   vs    182</p>
<p> Marcaine					152   vs    156</p>
<p> Ramace					  118   vs    105</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
